  "bio": "As one of Brisbane's exceptional talents, Timothy Zosh is renowned for his precision and creativity in the tattoo world. Specializing in fineline, lettering, and the distinctive trashpolka style, his work perfectly encapsulates the essence of black and grey realism, pop culture motifs, and illustrative flair. Clients visiting Cb Ink Tattoo Brisbane can expect a showcase of professionalism that is reflected in both Timothy's artistic expertise and the immaculate condition of his workspace.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Brisbane, Queensland, Australia"
